<title>USA: Warnaco says to buy back up to 2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Warnaco says to buy back up to 2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warnaco Group Inc on Wednesday said it will repurchase up to two million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>As of October 5, when its third fiscal quarter ended, the company had 53.3 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
